{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13214210","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13214210","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1321421001:1":{"text":"気分はどうですか？","source_cn":"怎么样，你现在感觉还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73BE1BCEF18D4447","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321421002:1":{"text":"だいぶ良くなったよ……出血も止まったみたいだし、傷の痛みも和らいでる。","source_cn":"确实好多了……伤口没有之前那么疼，出血好像也止住了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3A34D0962FDFB95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321421003:1":{"text":"うん、顔色も良くなってきたね！","source_cn":"是啊，哥哥你的脸色都好了不少呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x936F75508D3A2620","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321421004:1":{"text":"今日は本当にありがとう。ずっとピーターの面倒をみてもらったうえ、俺までずいぶん迷惑をかけてしまった。","source_cn":"今天的事都要感谢你们。不但一直陪着彼得，还帮了我这么多。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x13FAB5CD25C65017","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"今日は本当にありがとう。ずっとピーターの面倒をみてもらったうえ、俺までずいぶん迷惑をかけてしまった。","female":"今日は本当にありがとう。ずっとピーターの面倒をみてもらったうえ、俺までずいぶん迷惑をかけてしまった。","variant_male_record_index":"150344","variant_female_record_index":"150345","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321421005:1":{"text":"お気になさらず！それで実は、今日はあなたに聞きたいことがあって来たんです。","source_cn":"不用客气！其实我们来找你，也是有事想要问你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53BF2C65988C8EC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321421006:1":{"text":"カミンスキー家をご存じですか？町のお年寄りの方から、あなたたちがホワイトマウンテン公国に残る唯一の親戚だと聞きました。","source_cn":"你知道卡明斯基家族吗？听镇上的老人说，他们在白山公国的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5664717496CB6B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321421007:1":{"text":"少しだけなら知ってるけど、どうしてカミンスキー家のことを知りたいんだ？","source_cn":"我的确知道一些事。但我得冒昧问一句，你们为什么要打听卡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD52721557518CB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1321421007":{"text":"少しだけなら知ってるけど、どうしてカミンスキー家のことを知りたいんだ？","source_cn":"我的确知道一些事。但我得冒昧问一句，你们为什么要打听卡明斯基的事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD52721557518CB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321421008:1":{"text":"戦士？いや、もう長らくカミンスキー家に戦士などいないはずだ……","source_cn":"战士？不对啊，卡明斯基家族很久都没有出过战士了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD33C7939538DCC3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321421009:1":{"text":"このお守りを見れば分かりますよ！","source_cn":"你看了这个护身符就都明白了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52E156A0C344C411","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:15::0":{"text":"ボロボロのお守り","source_cn":"破旧的护身符","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x471FF9DFE336B376","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321421012:1":{"text":"「女神よヤン・カミンスキーをお守りください」……これは！？","source_cn":"“愿女神保佑扬·卡明斯基”……？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B382F87428761A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1321421013:1":{"text":"これはある生きた屍が身につけていたものです。ご存じないかもしれませんが……古戦場を徘徊する屍は、かつて神魔大戦に参加した戦士たちなのです。","source_cn":"这是我们在一个活死人身上找到的东西。你应该还不知道……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4A2BAFA3644F18E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1321421014:1":{"text":"生前はとても勇ましい戦士だったのでしょう。死してなおこの場所に留まり、カタストロフを追い払おうとしているのです。","source_cn":"我想，那位战士生前一定非常英勇，所以直到死后依然坚守在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03AC966DEF5B34F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1321421015:1":{"text":"だからこのお守りは、その子孫に持っていてほしいと思ったんです。","source_cn":"所以我们才想把这枚护身符还给他的后裔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B25BF314CEFB0B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1321421016:1":{"text":"……そういうことだったのか！","source_cn":"原来……竟然是这样……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0CED324175FB11D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1321421017:1":{"text":"お兄ちゃん、何をそんなに興奮してるの？カミンスキー家なんて僕たち関係ないよね。","source_cn":"哥哥你这么激动干嘛？卡明斯基的事和我们又没什么关系。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE8BDE3C909B80F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1321421018:1":{"text":"関係ない？おおありだよ！……ピーター、俺たちはカミンスキー家なんだ。カミンスキーが本当の名字なんだよ！","source_cn":"没关系？！怎么可能没关系！卡明斯基……彼得，我们就是卡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D1DFE63853CDE55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1321421019:1":{"text":"……えっ！？","source_cn":"……啊？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23839CC3CB9C29D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1321421020:1":{"text":"えっ！？カレフではなかったのですか！？","source_cn":"什么？！你们不是姓卡列夫吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F76903D62792DB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1321421021:1":{"text":"