だけ町に戻って、家族との再会を試みたことがあったんだ。","source_cn":"就像你们说的那样，我们的先祖的确变成了活死人。然后……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04414330E1A8F4C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1321421027:1":{"text":"町の人々は、さぞ恐怖したのでしょうね。","source_cn":"那恐怕会吓坏不少人吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F42EDA4AC2489C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1321421028:1":{"text":"そうさ。みんな生きた屍のことを、カタストロフの眷族だと思ってるからな。カミンスキーの先祖は女神を裏切り、悪魔に魂を売ったと……","source_cn":"没错。大家都以为活死人是恶魔的眷属，以为卡明斯基的先祖...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D770104C7C2B582","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1321421029:1":{"text":"それ以来、俺たちは裏切り者の血を継ぐ者と非難され、誰からも疎まれるようになった……","source_cn":"从那之后，卡明斯基的后裔就背上了恶名。所有人都唾弃我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC02D304C8D44CD61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1321421030:1":{"text":"最悪なことに、一族の中にまで先祖がカタストロフと結託したと信じる者が現れた。カミンスキーの姓を捨てて郊外に移り住む者もいれば、公国を後にする者もいる……","source_cn":"最可怕的是，家族中一些无从得知真相的人也渐渐相信先祖曾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AB36C9CB4AADA8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1321421031:1":{"