ment_title_status":""},"say:48:1321421035:1":{"text":"そうだよ。","source_cn":"是的。<key:dialog32>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x299514988EB51459","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1321421039:1":{"text":"だけど、人から臆病者呼ばわりされてたとき……逃がしたことを後悔せずにはいられなかった。","source_cn":"可是，在我被开除之后，在我听到别人骂我是懦夫的时候……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC447A100EEF192D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1321421040:1":{"text":"俺はもう一度生きた屍と戦い、自分自身を証明しなければならなかった。さもないと、カミンスキー家の名誉は永遠に取り戻せない！","source_cn":"我来这里和活死人战斗，就是想证明自己，证明卡明斯基家族...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A042DFA5FD37049","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:51:1321421040":{"text":"俺はもう一度生きた屍と戦い、自分自身を証明しなければならなかった。さもないと、カミンスキー家の名誉は永遠に取り戻せない！","source_cn":"我来这里和活死人战斗，就是想证明自己，证明卡明斯基家族绝没有大家说的那么不堪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A042DFA5FD37049","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1321421041:1":{"text":"ああ……やっぱり俺たちの先祖は臆病者などではなかった。あの女将軍のように、正真正銘の英雄だったんだ！","source_cn":"没错……我们的先祖不是懦夫，而是一位英勇的战士！是和女...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9491E80C68918ED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1321421042:1":{"text":"よかったな、ピーター……これからはもうカミンスキーの子孫だからと恥じる必要もない。むしろ、先祖を誇りに生きていくことができるんだ！","source_cn":"太好了，彼得……我们以后再也不用因为是卡明斯基的后裔而...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5CE57A40A37CF51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1321421043:1":{"text":"……ふんっ、恥じるも何も、僕は今まで何も知らなかったんだからね！","source_cn":"……哼，你都没告诉过我这件事，我都没机会抬不起头！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64382B7EE8B0499B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1321421044:1":{"text":"でも、これからもしカミンスキー家のことを悪く言う人がいたら、僕も大声で言い返してやる！","source_cn":"不过以后要是还有人诋毁卡明斯基家族，我就有机会骂回去了——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFF60532A4A31C88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1321421045:1":{"text":"ははは、そうだ！ついに一族の名誉を取り戻すチャンスが巡ってきたぞ！","source_cn":"哈哈，是啊，我们总算有机会为家族正名了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67B07B7DCCB08765","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1321421046:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style><male>さん</male><female>さん</female>、俺たちの先祖、<style=\"highlight\">そのお守りを身につけていた生きた屍</style>にはまだ会える？俺は彼をここに<style=\"highlight\">埋葬</style>し、安らかに眠らせてあげたいんだ。","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC03BB93898CD7968","variant_status":"run